{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfqLwdEoYLGerdeS52ok","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For this high-spin octahedral d⁷ complex, **Dq ≈ 979 cm⁻¹ (10Dq ≈ 9 790 cm⁻¹) and B ≈ 853 cm⁻¹**. This requires assigning 18 410 cm⁻¹ to ν₂ and 20 250 cm⁻¹ to ν₃. C cannot be found from these bands.\n\n**Model.** Take the ground term as ⁴T₁g(F), set the free-ion ⁴F energy to 0 and place ⁴P at 15B.\n\n- ⁴T₂g has energy +2Dq and ⁴A₂g has energy +12Dq.\n- The two ⁴T₁g states, ⁴T₁g(F) and ⁴T₁g(P), mix. Their energies are the roots of the 2×2 matrix [[−6Dq, 4Dq], [4Dq, 15B]]:\n E(⁴T₁g) = 7.5B − 3Dq ∓ ½√(225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n\nThis gives the three spin-allowed transitions:\n\n- ν₁ (⁴T₁g → ⁴T₂g) = 2Dq − E₀\n- ν₂ (⁴T₁g → ⁴A₂g) = 12Dq − E₀\n- ν₃ (⁴T₁g → ⁴T₁g(P)) = √(225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n\nHere E₀ is the lower ⁴T₁g root, the ground state. It follows that ν₂ − ν₁ = 10Dq exactly.\n\n**Choosing the assignment.**\n\n1. **ν₂ = 18 410, ν₃ = 20 250.**\n   - 10Dq = 18 410 − 8 620 = 9 790, so Dq = 979.\n   - E₀ = 2Dq − ν₁ = 1 958 − 8 620 = −6 662.\n   - From E₀ = 7.5B − 3Dq − ν₃/2: 7.5B = −6 662 + 2 937 + 10 125 = 6 400, so B ≈ 853.\n   - Check: ν₃ calculated = √(225·853² + 180·853·979 + 100·979²) ≈ 20 246 cm⁻¹. This matches the observed 20 250 cm⁻¹.\n2. **ν₂ = 20 250, ν₃ = 18 410.**\n   - This gives Dq = 1 163.\n   - The same steps again give B ≈ 853.\n   - The calculated ν₃ is then about 21 860 cm⁻¹, not the observed 18 410, so this assignment is rejected.\n\nSo the three bands are:\n- 8 620 cm⁻¹: ⁴T₂g\n- 18 410 cm⁻¹: ⁴A₂g\n- 20 250 cm⁻¹: ⁴T₁g(P)\n\n**Why C cannot be found.** All three bands are spin-allowed quartet → quartet transitions. Their energies depend only on Dq and B. Determining C would need a spin-forbidden (doublet) band.\n\n{\"Dq\": 979, \"B\": 853, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"High-spin d7 fit with nu2-nu1=10Dq gives Dq=979 and B=853; C cannot be found from spin-allowed bands alone.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":806,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"370034ed-3196-48ff-8270-be27ed30eaa5","uuid":"d01fc542-9185-4fe2-85e9-7e75a2d0457c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T10:26:54.732Z","request_id":"req_011CgfqLwKswX3bYJzj1LTwG"}
